        <path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"/>
        <path d="M8 12h.01"/>
        <path d="M12 12h.01"/>
        <path d="M16 12h.01"/>
      </svg>),
        eyebrow: "For creative teams",
        title: "Protect the idea through every round of feedback",
        body: "Hold onto the original intent while reviews, approvals, and handoffs move forward around a shared understanding.",
        outcome: "Keep the work coherent",
